music|Organized sound allows voices and instruments without requiring both. Guests and soft music align in Vietnamese; uncountability checked without narrowing all music to melody alone.
rupture|Pipe burst demonstrates intransitive meaning, with corresponding transitive use noted. Frozen condition and night preserved; no medical causal or treatment claim introduced.
september|Calendar month and in construction checked; examples capitalize September. Normalized group key remains lowercase; a separate display-only decision will preserve proper-name capitalization without identity change.
whenever|Repeated occurrence and free-choice timing are meaningful clause interpretations of the same source ordinal. Door bell and book return examples distinguish them; future-time clause does not require future tense.
clay|Pottery material boundary supported; wet mouldability qualified by water rather than asserting all soil behaves the same. Dish shape and Vietnamese noun classification align.
